INT. SERVICE ELEVATOR - OFFICE TOWER - NIGHT

Dim steel. Floor numbers drop. 22. 21. 20.

AGENT SOLOMON KIPKORIR (30s, earpiece, black suit) stands rigid. Briefcase cuffed to wrist.

Beside him: DR. FIONNUALA BRADY (40s, lab coat, ID badge). Pale. Silent.

                    SOLOMON
          Stay behind me.

                    FIONNUALA
          I am behind you.

The elevator stops. 14. Doors hiss.

A cleaning cart rolls in. Behind it, a JANITOR (50s, cap low, mop in hand). He nods.

                    JANITOR
          Evening.

The doors close. 13. 12. Solomon's hand drifts to his jacket.

The Janitor smiles. Lifts the mop. A blade glints in the handle.

Solomon moves first. Fist. Elbow. The mop clatters. The Janitor staggers into the wall. Fionnuala screams.

The elevator lurches. Lights die. Dark.

A thud. A grunt. Silence.

Lights return. Solomon stands, breathing hard. The Janitor lies crumpled.

                    FIONNUALA
          Is he--

                    SOLOMON
          Breathing.

The doors open. Lobby. Marble. Quiet.

He uncuffs the briefcase, hands it to her, and walks out.
